<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Linear Tech upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Linear Tech upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it upgraded Linear Technology Corp to buy from hold, putting a 12-month price target of $57 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- In a report, analyst Mark FitzGerald noted the company's fiscal second quarter earnings of $0.40 a share reported Tuesday were above his estimate of $0.38.</p>
<p>-- Said the company's fundamentals were improving.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/4 to 48-1/4.</p>
</text>
